SUMMARY:Payroll source deductions due (regular remitters)
DESCRIPTION:CPP\, EI and income tax withheld in the previous month. Quart
 erly remitters pay on April 15\, July 15\, October 15 and January 15. Ac
 celerated remitters have earlier dates. Who: Employers remitting monthly
 . If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CRA
  treats it as on time if received the next business day. More: https://w
 ww.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
