SUMMARY:HST/GST return and payment — quarterly filers
DESCRIPTION:One month after the end of each calendar quarter. Annual file
 rs who owed more than $3\,000 last year pay quarterly instalments on the
  same dates. Who: Quarterly filers on calendar quarters\; annual filers'
  instalments. If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or public holid
 ay\, the CRA treats it as on time if received the next business day. Mor
 e: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
